### ===================================================================
### СтройОптТорг — REST API So'rovlar to'plami (IntelliJ HTTP Client)
### Swagger UI brauzerda: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html
### OpenAPI 3 JSON spetsifikatsiyasi: http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs
### ===================================================================

### 0) OpenAPI 3 spetsifikatsiyasi (JSON)
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. AUTENTIFIKATSIYA
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1) Admin sifatida kirish (token avtomatik saqlanadi)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@stroy.local",
  "password": "Admin12345!"
}

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.token); %}

### 1.2) Yangi mijoz ro'yxatdan o'tishi
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jasur Abdullayev",
  "email": "jasur@stroy.local",
  "phone": "+998901234567",
  "companyName": "Jasur Qurilish Servis MCHJ",
  "password": "Parol12345!"
}

> {% client.global.set("userToken", response.body.token); %}

### 1.3) Mijoz sifatida kirish
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jasur@stroy.local",
  "password": "Parol12345!"
}

> {% client.global.set("userToken", response.body.token); %}

### 1.4) Joriy foydalanuvchi ma'lumotlari (profil)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. KATEGORIYALAR
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1) Barcha kategoriyalar ro'yxati
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories

### 2.2) Bitta kategoriyani ID bo'yicha olish
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories/1

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. MAHSULOTLAR
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1) Mahsulotlar katalogi (qidiruv, filtr, saralash)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?q=цемент&sort=price_asc&page=0&size=12

### 3.2) Kategoriya bo'yicha filtrlash
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?categoryId=1&sort=newest&page=0&size=10

### 3.3) Mahsulot tafsilotlari
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. BUYURTMALAR (Mijoz)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1) Yangi buyurtma berish (mijoz tokeni bilan)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Jasur Abdullayev",
  "phone": "+998901234567",
  "address": "Toshkent shahri, Yunusobod tumani, 12-mavze",
  "comment": "Ob'ektga soat 10:00 gacha yetkazib berilsin, kran bor",
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 20 },
    { "productId": 5, "quantity": 1000 }
  ]
}

### 4.2) Mening buyurtmalarim ro'yxati
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 4.3) Buyurtmani bekor qilish
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. ALOQA (Bog'lanish xabari)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1) Saytdan xabar yuborish
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rustam",
  "phone": "+998909876543",
  "message": "Assalomu alaykum, 50 tonna armatura uchun chegirma bormi?"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. ADMIN — KATALOG BOSHQARUVI
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1) Admin: Yangi kategoriya yaratish
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Yog'och va taxta materiallari",
  "description": "Brus, taxta, fanera va OSB plitalar"
}

### 6.2) Admin: Yangi mahsulot qo'shish
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kafel 30x30 sm Keramin",
  "sku": "TILE-KER-3030",
  "description": "Pol uchun mustahkam keramika kafel",
  "price": 85000,
  "unit": "м²",
  "minOrderQuantity": 10,
  "stock": 1500,
  "imageUrl": null,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "active": true
}

### 6.3) Admin: Mahsulotni tahrirlash
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Цемент М400 (50 кг) Yangilangan",
  "sku": "CEM-M400-50",
  "description": "Yuqori sifatli portlandsement",
  "price": 63000,
  "unit": "мешок",
  "minOrderQuantity": 20,
  "stock": 4800,
  "imageUrl": null,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "active": true
}

### 6.4) Admin: Mahsulotni sotuvdan olish (Soft delete)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. ADMIN — BUYURTMALAR VA STATISTIKA
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 7.1) Admin: Barcha buyurtmalar ro'yxati
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/orders?status=NEW&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7.2) Admin: Buyurtma holatini yangilash (CONFIRMED -> SHIPPED -> DELIVERED)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/admin/orders/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CONFIRMED"
}

### 7.3) Admin: Boshqaruv paneli statistikasi
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. ADMIN — ALOQA XABARLARI
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 8.1) Admin: Xabarlar ro'yxati
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/contacts?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8.2) Admin: Xabarni qayta ishlangan deb belgilash
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/admin/contacts/1/processed?value=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
